{"3746740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Muay Mayhem", "steam_appid": 3746740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dive into multiple modes like career, quick fights, or local and online multiplayer. Whether you're chasing a belt or just throwing down with friends, Muay Mayhem brings tight, satisfying action that hits hard.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Key Features</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Stand-Up Only Gameplay – Pure striking. No ground game, just hands, feet, knees, and elbows</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Fighter Stats – Level up and customize your fighter’s strengths and fighting style</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Fight Settings – Adjust rules, difficulty, and round structure to your liking</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Character Customization – Change up your fighter’s appearance and vibe</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Emotes – Taunt, flex, or celebrate mid-fight</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Game Modes</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Career Mode – Climb the ranks, earn rewards, and make a name for yourself</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Quick Fight Mode – Hop into a match instantly with no setup</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Player vs AI – Train or challenge smart computer opponents</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Local Multiplayer – Throw hands with friends on the same screen</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Online Multiplayer – Face off against players worldwide in real time</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><stron